              "heading": "How to Convert Your ZX Bank Savings Account to a Salary Account"
            },
            "text": "If you're joining a new company, or your employer has partnered with ZX Bank for salary disbursement, you may want to convert your existing savings account into a salary account for added benefits. This guide walks you through the process with ZX Bank."
          }
        ],
