                    "location": {
                      "line": 67,
                      "heading": "Q: Can I convert online?"
                    },
                    "text": "A: Yes, if your employer is registered with ZX Bank and your KYC is up to date, you can use the ZX Bank Asia app or NetBanking for conversion."
